SPS.4A.9F_7 {@ Minimum POLY1 on field region to DIFFUSION spacing is 0.065um when the common run length  between 0.145 to 0.165 (0.145< x <=0.165)
   E = EXT PO1_SPS DIFF < 0.065 PROJ > 0.145 <= 0.165 SINGULAR REGION
