}

SP_16.4A.9AaBaC_4 {@ Minimum POLY1 width for 1.2V NMOS is 0.12 um
                   @ Minimum POLY1 width for 1.2V PMOS is 0.12 um
                   @ Minimum POLY1 width for interconnect is 0.12 um
                   @ others, When the common run length > 0.039 (0.039 < x)
    E = INT PO1_SP_16 < 0.12 ABUT>0<90 SINGULAR PROJ >0.039 REGION
    E AND SP_16
}

SP_16.4A.9D.a1_4A.9D.c1_1 {@ Minimum POLY1 to POLY1 spacing on DIFFUSION regions is 0.024 um
                           @ (without CONTACT) When the common run length <= 0.085 (x <= 0.085)
