SP_16.4A.9E_1 {@ Minimum POLY1 overhang of DIFFUSION is 0.18 um
               @ others, When the common run length <= 0 (x <= 0)
    E1 = ENC DIFF PO1_SP_16 < 0.18 ABUT<90 SINGULAR PROJ <=0 REGION
