}

SP_16.4A.13B_5 {@ Minimum CONTACT to CONTACT spacing is 0.19 um
                @ When the common run length between 0.161 to 0.173 (0.161 < x <= 0.173)
    E = EXT CONT < 0.19 ABUT>0<90 SINGULAR PROJ >0.161 <=0.173 REGION
    E AND SP_16
}

SP_16.4A.13B_6 {@ Minimum CONTACT to CONTACT spacing is 0.2 um
